# SPA fallback + real crawler files.
#
# Read by Netlify, Cloudflare Pages and other hosts that support a `_redirects`
# file. The authoritative configuration for the current Render static site lives
# in render.yaml (or in the dashboard's Redirects/Rewrites tab) — this file is a
# harmless, portable equivalent so a host change does not silently break deep
# links.
#
# Files that exist on disk always win, so the build-time prerendered pages
# (/product/<slug>/index.html and friends) are served as themselves.

/robots.txt    /robots.txt    200
/sitemap.xml   /sitemap.xml   200
/*             /index.html    200
